#: scenario2:scenario2_90DC954B_85AB_4D14_9969_34AE653F673B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ffd7a58fccf215d2eebf2536352e1566585840394a397093532bfcc29fba2c8
