msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_661D5D51_C0CA_4BD0_AC8A_2B5045A5B24B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He could not sense anyone else inside, though. ⟪k:1⟫All he could hear was the ⟪k:2⟫"
"whoosh⟪k:3⟫ of the wind blowing into the house from somewhere."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais il ne percevait aucune autre présence. ⟪k:1⟫Il n’entendait que le ⟪k:2⟫sifflement⟪k:3⟫ "
"du vent qui s’engouffrait dans la maison."

